Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: improve portfolio for PFE applications
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Align all content with the real CV: SIGA internship (Spring Boot/Angular),
  Tunisie Télécom internships, Minassa, SmartDent, education, languages
- Remove invented data: skill percentages, GitHub stats and contribution graph,
  fake results/challenges, placeholder domain and LinkedIn
- Add certifications and student-club section (NVIDIA, IEEE, Centre 4C, Selenium)
- Show honest project status (In progress / Early stage / Personal lab)
- GitHub section now uses live public API data with graceful fallback
- Contact form uses mailto instead of a non-functional endpoint
- Self-host fonts with @fontsource so builds work without Google Fonts access
- Hide CV/LinkedIn buttons until real URLs are configured in data/nav.ts
- Add typecheck script and update README
